    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-33-47">青いぞ、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-47-73">ゆきはまつさを、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-73-114">もも、さくらぎに花咲かず、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-114-137">青いこなゆき、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-137-172">光る山路に泣きくらす。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-172-184">青いぞ。</seg></p>
    </body>
